  - m_Id: 35772882944
    m_Localized: We're hungry little mice, if only we could find at least a bread
      crumb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55437331980288
    m_Localized: Now we're full, but we wouldn't say no to a bite of an apple
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55443283697664
    m_Localized: And here's an onion that makes rivers of tears pour. To keep from
      crying, we've got to eat it too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55447226343424
    m_Localized: "I heard cabbage \u2014 aka greens - 'totally' solves a bunch of
      problems. So let's stock up on it, just in case"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55450313351168
    m_Localized: Carrots are packed with vitamin "A." The most beneficial vitamin!
      Let's take care of our health
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55452796379136
    m_Localized: We're not sure if these mushrooms are edible. But there's only one
      way to find out. Let's run a scientific experiment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55455245852672
    m_Localized: I feel like this bowl of cucumbers just gave us a dirty look. Folks,
      let's go sort this out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55456822910976
    m_Localized: 'A scout mouse got stuck in the meat. There are two ways to pull
      him out: carefully and quickly. Bro, we''re already on our way, hang in there!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55458399969280
    m_Localized: They say grapes are the future wine. And we're against drinking!
      We'll have to eat them now, before they get covered in a glass bottle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55460010582016
    m_Localized: We've always been afraid of these scary pumpkins! Especially on
      Halloween. But today we're ready to face our fears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55461788966912
    m_Localized: "The smell of this cheese is making the wallpaper slide off the
      walls \u2014 we need to eat it urgently to save the interior"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55464238440448
    m_Localized: They say if you get the hole from a donut, you'll become happy.
      Worth a try
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55465781944320
    m_Localized: It has meat, vegetables, and bread. That's a balanced meal! Dietitians
      approve. Well, we hope so
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55467321253888
    m_Localized: We have a new super-important mission. We need to hide the potato
      stick so that nobody finds it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55468965421056
    m_Localized: Unfortunately, we eat not only when we're hungry, but also when
      we're full
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55470643142656
    m_Localized: "The world is very strange: the pizza box is square, the pizza itself
      is round, the slices are triangular, and my jokes are flat\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55473096810496
    m_Localized: Just look at those legs! Damn! Beautiful! Tanned! Shiny! How can
      anyone resist them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55474678063104
    m_Localized: "It's suddenly gotten hot \u2014 we need to cool down with something"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55476188012544
    m_Localized: It's suddenly gotten cold for some reason. Strange. We need to warm
      up with something
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55477827985408
    m_Localized: We've decided to go on a diet. But first we need to finish everything
      left in the house. So it doesn't go to waste
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55479371489280
    m_Localized: To lose weight we'll eat only diet food! Here, for example, quiche.
      With cheese, sour cream, crispy pastry, and tomatoes! It has diet peppers in
      it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55933631389696
    m_Localized: Looks like the previous dish didn't help us lose weight, so let's
      try eating another dish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55963457085440
    m_Localized: Why does everyone love these hunched-over not-quite-lobsters? We
      should check
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55966313406464
    m_Localized: This is a perishable product. So we need to devour them ASAP!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55969069064192
    m_Localized: Experts say you can eat no more than 2-3 pancakes a day. But actually,
      23 is written as one word
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55980003614720
    m_Localized: Japanese people are slim! And Japanese people eat ramen! So ramen
      is their secret to slimness! We've found it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55986479620096
    m_Localized: We can go all day without eating cake! We have iron willpower! Oh!
      And here comes nighttime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55990275465216
    m_Localized: "This isn't just meat, it's a work of art! We're partaking in the
      sublime\u2026 and chewing a little"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55996780830720
    m_Localized: Come up with a joke! Don't forget!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63040632053760
    m_Localized: That's it! We're completely full! There's no more room in us, but
      here SHE is! We call her Helleanor von Turkeyton the Third! The final boss
      of the game, by the way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 321847039811584
    m_Localized: New levels are coming soon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
